    "text": {
     "en": "(additional, not in the textbook) The class party also needs data. We can collect it with tally marks.\nMake one stroke for each child. Four strokes and then a fifth stroke across them makes a group of 5.\nCount in fives to find the total quickly.\nWrite the totals in a table with two columns, the item and the number.\nA picture graph shows the same data with one picture for each child. The longest row is the most liked item."
    }
